ace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"BxqNxIOcaLjHzGa0m0foXQ","review_id":"yV0e0DP6zESGze9v0XN7Og","date":"2018-07-10T13:50:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9504285454750061,"text_excerpt":"Wow! I rarely give 5 stars, but after walking by this place on Magazine for years, I feel it's long overdue. Went in on a Sunday early (11am), and checked out the menu. It was a small brunch selection, maybe 10 choices. I would rather have a small, well done, fresh selection than 200 menu items that have to be frozen in order to keep in stock. The restaurant has nice country, clean decor. Beautiful bar area, nice tables, and very nice linen napkins. Our server was friendly and helpful. We started with a couple of Bloody Mary's, I don't like it too spicy, so he brought both plain and a bottle of horseradish/habanero sauce to put in as desired. Perfect! THE FOOD: I ordered a Crab Melt which..."},{"business_id":"BxqNxIOcaLjHzGa0m0foXQ","review_id":"sCl1inDyJhrxE8pD9fyajg","date":"2016-01-06T14:55:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9414705634117126,"text_excerpt":"Went there his past Saturday for brunch with a group of friends and was more than impressed. The service was amazing. Our waiter was so friendly that he actually shook each of our hands when we left and thanked us for coming in. We order a mimosa pitcher for $32 that was delicious and made with fresh squeezed orange juice, champagne, vodka and triple sec. I order the crab cakes Benedict for $15 with a side of cheese grits. The grits were amazing -definitely order them as your side and the crab were delicious. My friend who ordered the sweet potato pancake let me have a bite and I'm glad I did. It was delicioussssss. So good and was topped with melted brown sugar. The coffee was also amazi..."},{"business_id":"BxqNxIOcaLjHzGa0m0foXQ","review_id":"YJpsdrtiPwPZLcrROSktrQ","date":"2017-12-04T07:25:40","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9372580051422119,"text_excerpt":"Came here around ten am for brunch on a Saturday, was surprised to find no wait at all! The service here was fantastic, our server was very attentive and also quite charismatic. I ordered the traditional breakfast which was yummy. My favorite part of my meal was the side of grits it came with which were delicious! The other person I was with ordered the steak and eggs which judging by his entire plate being cleared he quite enjoyed. Prices were affordable and our table gave us a great view of magazine street. Would definitely come here again!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"BxqNxIOcaLjHzGa0m0foXQ","photo_id":"OXq41hVxFFFMmgFgV9fisA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/OXq41hVxFFFMmgFgV9fisA.jpg","visual_representa